    "issue": null,
    "reasoning": "The right triangular prism has AB, BD, and DF mutually perpendicular. Apply the Pythagorean theorem twice: BF^2=BD^2+DF^2 and AF^2=AB^2+BF^2, hence AF=sqrt(AB^2+BD^2+DF^2)."
